{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>They will press him</b> — \"they will press\": those who press, as in: <b>and they said to Joseph</b> (Genesis 50:16), each one of them [speaking]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 63, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra parses the hitpa'el form יתגוררו (Psalms 63:11) from the root גור in the sense of pressing/pursuing; the illustration from Genesis 50:16 draws on the plural subject functioning distributively."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:37.251150080Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}